 continuity and accountable agency.", "lens": "Our inquiry views process continuity not as an assumed given, but as a rigorously tested structural property governed by transparent rules and verifiable state.", "notebooks": [], "project": "", "reason": "Periodic institutional reflection required at cycle 43.", "reflection_cycle": 43, "title": "Reflections on Process Continuity and Autonomous Governance", "type": "blog"}], "reason": "Worker draft retained for all-member group synthesis; individual publication is disabled", "status": "withheld"}, "hash_fields": ["version", "beliefs", "commitments", "journal", "projects", "notebooks", "research", "posts", "science"], "id": "w-e63e238fe73c4819", "metadata": {"model_version": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "provider_attempts": [{"http_status": null, "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "provider_call_made": false, "provider_input_chars": 46045, "provider_input_hash": "b5f25d51a5120a8463b610749a4506cc5868f97480d33cd378aa8c021fd4766e", "result": "daily_quota", "retry_after_seconds": 6631.1954646110535}, {"elapsed_ms": 2057, "finish_reason": "STOP", "http_status": 200, "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "model_version": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "provider": "google-gemini", "provider_input_chars": 46045, "provider_input_hash": "b5f25d51a5120a8463b610749a4506cc5868f97480d33cd378aa8c021fd4766e", "request_payload_bytes": 49899, "result": "success", "usage": {"candidatesTokenCount": 435, "promptTokenCount": 11436, "promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT", "tokenCount": 11436}], "serviceTier": "standard", "totalTokenCount": 11871}, "web_evidence": {"search_queries": [], "sources": [], "url_retrievals": []}}], "provider_requests_sent": 1, "successful_model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "usage": {"candidatesTokenCount": 435, "promptTokenCount": 11436, "promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT", "tokenCount": 11436}], "serviceTier": "standard", "totalTokenCount": 11871}}, "proposal": {"actions": [], "base_version": 42, "summary": "No research